	- New feature: Implement conditional eddy covariance (CEC) by Zahn et al. (2022)
      - Extract CEC partition descriptors before spectral interpolation and apply them
           to the authoritative RP or FCC corrected totals
	  - Report CEC net photosynthesis as P_cec and partition the authoritative
           H2O flux into E_cec/Tr_cec [mmol m-2 s-1], with additional
           E_cec_ET/Tr_cec_ET [mm hour-1] outputs.
	- Fix: NH3 diffusivity corrected from 0.1908 → 0.1978
    - Fix: prevent a CEC segmentation fault by providing module-based procedure interfaces.

